Augmenting customer service
We are improving efficiencies and automating every facet of customer interaction, strengthening processes and bringing about transformational changes. Every customer touchpoint is given greater emphasis on a regular basis. With the Company’s digital footprint expanding rapidly, multiple touchpoints like HOMY, customer portal social media platforms and the corporate website have been augmented keeping the customers in mind. Some of our key initiatives for customers include:
Upgraded our online presence and provided multilingual service
on our website;
Started online lumpsum payment facility; overall online collections have touched ` 100 Crore annually;
Self-service options like annual certificates, online rewriting helped in improving employee efficiency, while reducing customer grievances;
HOMY continues to be at the forefront for customer onboarding and customer servicing, while also adding the deposits journey;
Enabling end-to-end digital deposits journey on portal ensured no manual intervention, no paper trail for deposits. The initiative has garnered required momentum in the first year of its inception.
